      "audioUrl": "audio/priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "You're haunted.",
      "duration": 1.126
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Infernus",
      "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "Ain't you heard?  The whole city's haunted.",
      "duration": 2.869
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Venator",
      "audioFile": "priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "You know what I mean.",
      "duration": 1.439
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Infernus",
      "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "I really thought I buried this part of me, ya know.",
      "duration": 2.908
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Venator",
      "audioFile": "priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_05.mp3",
      "text": "A lot of people try to bury the past.  Problem what that is whenever someone comes to go dig it up, they make a big mess.",
      "duration": 6.622
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "character": "Infernus",
      "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_06",
      "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_06.mp3",
      "text": "Got any advice?",
      "duration": 1.221
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "character": "Venator",
      "audioFile": "priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_07",
      "audioUrl": "audio/priest_match_start_priest_inferno_convo03_07.mp3",
      "text": "Yeah.  Win.  Otherwise you're torturing youself for 2nd place, and that's not worth it.",
      "duration": 6.95
    }
  ]
